haring","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3513510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Foddia?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foddia is a 2D-Platformer inspired by Getting Over It. There are difficult challenges to overcome and mysteries to uncover at every turn. Swing on ropes, make long jumps across chasms, and climb your way to the top of the Foddian Mountain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You came here for a reason.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Was it to climb this mountain that won't stop towering over you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Was it to search for secrets in the depths unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Was it to become the fastest hiker the world has ever seen?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The only certainty is that if you leave now...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may never know why you came in the first place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Game Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use momentum to your advantage to jump farther</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swing on construction ropes to propel yourself forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades and items to change the way you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fully voice-acted dialogue from a colorful cast of characters (or don't! I won't be sad!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game on one of three difficulties: Relaxed (made for beginners who are new to the Foddian genre), Foddian (for those accustomed to madness), and Permadeath (please don't choose this one, you won't have a good time I'm begging you)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Team Backrow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351110/header.jpg?t=174119